<title>PERU: Peru brewery group reports first financial results.</title>
<headline>Peru brewery group reports first financial results.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The brewery group Union de Cervecerias, which was formed December 31, 1996, from four breweries belonging to the Backus group, reported Friday its first financial results. All results are for the first quarter of the year.</p>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 16.2 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 204.2 million soles</p>
<p>NOTE: The Backus group merged its sister companies Backus y Johnston, Compania Nacional de Cerveza, Sociedad Cervecera de Trujillo SA and Cerveceria del Norte.</p>
<p>The full name of the new company is Union de Cervecerias Peruanas Backus y Johnston SA.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
